  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "把壁式储物盒固定在墙壁上，打造不碍事的储物和展示空间。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1b/10/1b106ea1a7504cff6e50cf793fca0c70.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1b/10/1b106ea1a7504cff6e50cf793fca0c70.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>开放式展示区</strong></p> <p>这些壁式储物盒可以固定在墙上任何位置，这样你不仅可以绝佳的方式展示你的物品，也可以精心放置储物件，用别具一格的方式展示物品。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "把碗盘收放在天花板旁边的封闭式碗柜中，让它们远离灰尘。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ad/59/ad592bebdfe81b364a464a7250a2ab8a.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ad/59/ad592bebdfe81b364a464a7250a2ab8a.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>隐而不见&nbsp;</strong></p> <p>有些你不太愿意展示的物品，就使用橱柜这种封闭式储物件，这样既能保证物品安全，不沾灰尘，还不挡道。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "打造一个可升降衣柜，不用的时候可以升起来，要换装时亦可降下来。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "10217155"
   ],
   "images": [
